        {
          "text": "Yiki nicho kigira ninyagula vulungi kuduuka hukumalirizira; yiki nicho kigira nimbeeye kuli mulwaani, utagotizaa zinguru zizie ku liduyaduya mwika vuzwa. ",
          "type": "text",
